in front of us on cue cards.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.709
But when the music stops,
we'll only see a blank.

00:00:10.709 --> 00:00:13.046
And it will be up to us to
finish the line correctly.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:15.081
If you don't get the lyrics
exactly right,

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:18.017
the microphone in front of you
will spray water in your face.

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:20.219
[ Laughter ]
But if you can slay it

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:21.954
and sing all the words
perfectly,

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:23.656
then your opponent gets
sprayed in the face.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.525
-I like it.
-Sound good?

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.293
-Let's do it.
-So we have our --

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.395
